        },
        {
          "text": "Mose anayankha kuti, \"Ine ndikangochoka pano, ndikapemphera kwa Yehova ndipo mawa lomweli ntchentche zoluma zidzachoka kwa Farao, nduna zake pamodzi ndi anthu ake. Koma Farao, onetsetsani kuti musachitenso zachinyengo ndi kuwakaniza anthu kuti asakapereke nsembe kwa Yehova.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
